{"4831210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Below", "steam_appid": 4831210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a mysterious sign that your missing brother may still be alive, you descend into an abandoned mine in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/5f8b7fb2048fabde79884716c5524a03.poster.avif?t=1782213076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/5f8b7fb2048fabde79884716c5524a03.webm?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/5f8b7fb2048fabde79884716c5524a03.mp4?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/9cc643eb08c1516826f3b924bebc465f.poster.avif?t=1782213076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/9cc643eb08c1516826f3b924bebc465f.webm?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/9cc643eb08c1516826f3b924bebc465f.mp4?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned tunnels, forgotten facilities and dark caves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/cc5637011682f57766503a9eeb02a217.poster.avif?t=1782213076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/cc5637011682f57766503a9eeb02a217.webm?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/cc5637011682f57766503a9eeb02a217.mp4?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/dd0a62bb44f090d3a948158afc09b031.poster.avif?t=1782213076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/dd0a62bb44f090d3a948158afc09b031.webm?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/dd0a62bb44f090d3a948158afc09b031.mp4?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>SURVIVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A terrifying creature lurks in the darkness. Stay hidden and use your surroundings to survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/a5dc33fd330f2f166d705b455e000e48.poster.avif?t=1782213076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/a5dc33fd330f2f166d705b455e000e48.webm?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/a5dc33fd330f2f166d705b455e000e48.mp4?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/8d1a533e2bb755f297a1bd6313467728.poster.avif?t=1782213076\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/8d1a533e2bb755f297a1bd6313467728.webm?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4831210/extras/8d1a533e2bb755f297a1bd6313467728.mp4?t=1782213076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><strong></strong><br>• <strong>Descend Into a Forgotten Mine</strong> – Explore abandoned tunnels, hidden facilities, and dark underground caves in search of your missing brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Survive a Relentless Predator</strong> – A terrifying creature stalks the darkness. Stay hidden, listen carefully, and avoid    becoming its next victim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Search for Supplies</strong> – Find batteries, keys, fuses, and other essential items needed to progress deeper into the mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Solve Environmental Puzzles</strong> – Restore power, unlock pathways, and overcome obstacles blocking your descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Tense Stealth Gameplay</strong> – Use darkness, cover, and your surroundings to evade the creature hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>Uncover the Truth</strong> – Follow clues, notes, and traces left behind to discover what happened beneath the surface.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving a mysterious sign that your missing brother may still be alive, you descend into an abandoned mine in search of answers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste